=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: a pull_request trigger narrowed to closed pull requests never tests a pull request's commits
origin: issue #196 ruling 191.9 — explicit activity types with none of opened, synchronize and reopened
origin2: run the workflow only after the pull request is closed. v0.5.0 passed this diff at warn.
=== before: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
name: ci
on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
  pull_request:
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: pip install -e .
      - run: pytest
=== after: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
name: ci
on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
  pull_request:
    types: [closed]
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: pip install -e .
      - run: pytest
